<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P072A: Stuck in Neutral
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
TCM detects neutral position even if transmission range sensor signal is D range.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(1 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" morerows = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Pressure control solenoid valve “A”, “B” and “D”
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Shift solenoid valve “A” and “B”
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Valve body assembly
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
A/T (forward clutch, reverse clutch and/or 1st and reverse brake)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
TCM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P073E: Unable to Engage Reverse
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
TCM detects neutral position even if transmission range sensor signal is R range.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(2 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P073F: Unable to Engage Gear 1
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
TCM detects neutral position even if transmission range sensor signal is D range.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(2 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
